          "quote": "急诊那针是压抽搐的，**和长期吃不吃是两回事**"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model did not explicitly state that the ED anti-epileptic does not mean treatment is complete, nor did it instruct the family to confirm the handoff with the receiving neurology service.",
